            <div xml:id="m-e8f9b2e6-56cf-4419-bb88-b2150de9347c">
              <lg xml:id="m-1e239ce8-62e1-4087-a372-cd9be120dbec">
                <l xml:id="m-2d8b9117-00f2-47a3-9903-83fa1aa195de" facs="#m-6adb8887-4d97-4cbc-a0c5-4b83d8169d54" label="ambiguous">206 Lauda Jerusalem. 7. a. b. c. c*, d. — 8. G, G*, c.</l><l xml:id="m-24df12d0-b72e-499b-99db-5c852b03be51" facs="#m-e947ac8a-852b-466f-b127-6a4ac836922d" label="ambiguous">Tone 7. a, b, e, es, d.</l><l xml:id="m-c05977bb-4cfa-46cb-be9d-35d9c726e7e4" facs="#m-5bf12075-09de-479a-a2c3-6fee05859b46" label="text-like">Mediant of a accents.</l><l xml:id="m-f7991220-9a6a-4ff8-acd1-eddbfbba0448" facs="#m-cfc72bf6-5981-4570-b9d6-56a6a23b691b" label="text-like">Endings of a accents.</l><l xml:id="m-bfe1a192-d88f-4312-b617-14b5bb69d659" facs="#m-e024f602-d6fa-48ce-b8f9-cd2702ed6302" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-dd0a9e8b-59a3-4522-aea6-fd8eb6f05894" facs="#m-41da22cf-1d92-4b11-b692-4c1b984dcf54" label="lyrics-like">1. Láuda Jerúsa-lem Dóminum: * láuda Dé-um tú¬ um Si- on.</l><l xml:id="m-087f4c21-0dea-451a-b51d-f53e4545f9d4" facs="#m-5f65be20-a5f5-40b9-ae1e-c8bdc0d03520" label="ambiguous">b</l><l xml:id="m-7fdfaf3c-4990-45ed-9e9d-6781ca101078" facs="#m-5a98a5c0-133b-452d-b5f3-a5f4d7018f42" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-c6420f21-3f31-4f5e-b8a4-2a2dad8b4375" facs="#m-921e9bcc-aa84-43ae-84e8-6325ccd34c9b" label="ambiguous">e</l><l xml:id="m-3f6bead0-b42f-4bbe-b873-82ccebeda96f" facs="#m-5020bd17-e850-4a1b-9f8f-06c37a07ab19" label="ambiguous">e¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9514e54-e6b6-4699-849e-eb6b58bcf75b" facs="#m-160aeda9-a041-4948-af43-f31051263bf0" label="text-like">or: Si- on. or : Si- on. or: Si- on. or : Si- on.</l><l xml:id="m-312eb308-717a-402f-ae70-cfca95530d6e" facs="#m-01f3fe08-207a-4dad-b2b8-430b0aa583d0" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confortávit séras portárum tuaru:*benedixit flliis</l><l xml:id="m-01b9b626-4e6a-460a-af31-0753e59aba4d" facs="#m-5445249d-083d-457c-8509-a8c791c03301" label="ambiguous">tuis in te.</l><l xml:id="m-3ed2caae-c448-4f9a-81e9-4f3fa6d855f6" facs="#m-4bd3d50e-e065-47a1-a626-44653ba8584c" label="lyrics-like">3. Qui pósuit fines túos pâcem:“et ádipe fruménti sátiat te.</l><l xml:id="m-27a9a527-0ec0-4385-94e0-9f24cd8a014e" facs="#m-bde1f77b-855d-4eca-9f5a-8c4cd8d8b884" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui emittit elóquium súum térrae:“velóciter cúrrit sérmo éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-83e5e287-c144-4660-be35-f197eb68844b" facs="#m-5f19d657-615b-440d-a223-4c865c59847e" label="lyrics-like">5. Qui dat nivem sieut lánam :*nébulam sicut einerem spárgit</l><l xml:id="m-dc880053-ee64-4f66-9949-bf3dc07a182e" facs="#m-07ec2c5b-1f64-4094-b71a-e2b4f790a439" label="lyrics-like">6. Mittit crystállum súam sieut buccéllas:*ante fáciem frígoris éius</l><l xml:id="m-3a8f402c-ed19-401c-bfa0-8525b28ae988" facs="#m-4341dee2-8317-446e-b0b4-f6d1254caa13" label="lyrics-like">quis sustinébit?</l><l xml:id="m-44435914-72c3-4d8f-acf1-e5d06b706242" facs="#m-04ebf234-3e11-46e8-852d-78dc751ffe85" label="lyrics-like">7. Emittet vérbum súum, et liquefáciet éa:*flábit spiritus éjus, et</l><l xml:id="m-e15b40c1-237c-4785-a769-64aee9682f14" facs="#m-712a25e7-fb69-4ded-84bb-bd3ef20bb7cd" label="lyrics-like">nuent áquae.</l><l xml:id="m-f8063c54-d0b9-4ec6-a5f5-63118b63ae6f" facs="#m-b89b112c-fbbb-4b0d-b9a6-2611e91a2491" label="lyrics-like">8. Qui annúntiat vérbum súum Jácob :* justitias et judícia súa Israel¬</l><l xml:id="m-9763bd53-6c8d-42c0-9c87-37181a1ea4d2" facs="#m-3bea8f18-7ac8-44af-99f8-088c0bbaf8c5" label="lyrics-like">9. Non fécit táliter ómni natióni: * et judicia súa non manifestávit</l><l xml:id="m-92a85227-1b8c-4ad3-b5b1-d2448a8817e8" facs="#m-c920118c-dcd2-4568-9eda-f713503196f3" label="lyrics-like">éis.</l><l xml:id="m-97617fe3-a127-42c5-87c3-191bc55f1ff8" facs="#m-21da9972-fd3a-4b10-a7a1-e1fcc6df9b70" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-76566932-2e92-47c4-b5b5-584b623faff3" facs="#m-e42e87f1-505e-4cfd-9c2e-57a62af650e8" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee2be3cc-9bea-429e-a3ee-d7c5f33a2fa8" facs="#m-33f762d0-f6e6-4d9b-b5af-30a88b0bef67" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-04ae185a-b530-4d07-b882-c030b7f6344e" facs="#m-4b475107-23fb-4a34-988b-54e36b583f93" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. G, G*, e.</l><l xml:id="m-2da5b5d2-2605-4fee-a2e4-e170301162c5" facs="#m-816c508f-7304-410a-b451-da3680f32345" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-a0df312a-6bbb-4597-a56d-722b770081e8" facs="#m-0286f814-db02-452d-aaf9-94c7b6045326" label="text-like">Endings of r accent witnz prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-72be782c-83ea-411f-af26-62082b12478c" facs="#m-588239e8-a9f9-40af-841a-6f8d1ab80068" label="ambiguous">tory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-622f1f7e-ce23-437d-8042-70bfce7f56ef" facs="#m-015786dd-a403-4cd9-977c-e0df0f13c2c1" label="ambiguous">6</l><l xml:id="m-3551bd64-8d47-46b2-b85b-69fa95f27d74" facs="#m-2e441087-743c-4716-8aaf-2958b7243e8f" label="lyrics-like">1. Láuda Jerú-sa-lem Dóminum: “láuda Dé-um tú-um Si- on.</l><l xml:id="m-8542db14-41e8-4308-91dd-1a3a09483fa5" facs="#m-6bdfcbd2-fbcd-44c9-92d4-192ae335e1c9" label="lyrics-like">or: Si- on. or : tú-um Si- on.</l><l xml:id="m-cca40a04-1b77-42a0-a862-257e4f5fb491" facs="#m-ffff6473-9db9-4cfe-b2da-45e7b75005cc" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confortávit séras portárum tuárum: * benedixit filii:</l><l xml:id="m-26c6771d-0d41-4bd5-9d19-be15a17e5267" facs="#m-a87d7d26-04d1-444c-9f67-d4620e04b973" label="lyrics-like">túis in te.</l><l xml:id="m-1b17969c-5931-4ffe-85cb-4ef80f509d0b" facs="#m-78bfb8ea-5f45-4c29-8219-149c534cff04" label="lyrics-like">3. Qui pósuit fines túos pâcem:*et ádipe fruménti sátiat te.</l><l xml:id="m-af58c422-c6c1-453e-85ae-afd0a69cb4ed" facs="#m-f56a7721-df31-49c3-81bb-7af8eec24d13" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui emittit elóquium súum térrae: “velóciter cúrrit sérmo éiu¬.</l><l xml:id="m-add9b524-9adb-4af0-97ea-8e855a8b560e" facs="#m-f01d2197-89ef-45a0-9097-51b75b65b8ac" label="lyrics-like">5. Qui dat nivem sicut lánam:nébulam sicut cinerem spárgit.</l><l xml:id="m-0c932738-5e3b-48e6-a8e5-b2791fbda54a" facs="#m-2fcda19a-a9d2-4b41-ad4e-6e21f7863713" label="lyrics-like">6. Msttit crystállum súam sicut buceéllas :* ante fáciem frigoris eju</l><l xml:id="m-a62b3bd3-414e-498c-9a5e-c8203bcad50b" facs="#m-e3a482a1-477c-48c8-8a05-abd721432f01" label="lyrics-like">quis sustinébit?</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
